# PG Ship Allowlist for Persona Desktop
# Specifies what content is allowed in public/general-rated builds
# Format: newline-delimited path globs; everything not matched is excluded
# IMPORTANT: This is an allowlist, not a denylist. Omissions make the artifact
# SMALLER, never leakier.

# Root-level project files (specific, not wildcard)
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
SECURITY.md
ASSET_LICENSES.md
LICENSE
package.json
package-lock.json
.npmrc
.gitattributes
index.html
vite.config.ts
vitest.config.ts
tsconfig.json
tsconfig.app.json
tsconfig.node.json
eslint.config.js

# Build and config directories
public/**
docs/**
native/**
build/**

# Source code
src/**
electron/**

# Directory-level files (no wildcard, prevents deep matches)
.github/workflows/**

# Character directories — NONE ship.
#
# Deliberately no `characters/**` entries and no roster listing: characters/
# is per-user runtime state (a VRM the user enrolled themselves), and this
# file is public. A public build config must not enumerate anybody's roster;
# an unmatched path is excluded, so the artifact is smaller, never leakier.
# Desk ships no character models at all — see ASSET_LICENSES.md.
